What was taken: the visual starting point of a number of presenton slide
layouts (arrangement of title / text / image regions). What was changed:
rewritten as React components on a 1000 x 562.5 coordinate system, slot-based
data contract, Chinese typesetting, decorative accent lines removed, plus
original layouts. No presenton source file is included unmodified.

About the upstream NOTICE file (Apache-2.0 §4(d)):
presenton's own NOTICE file (same commit, 1,274,338 bytes) consists only of
the license texts of the third-party Python and npm packages bundled in
presenton's application image (e.g. aioquic, passlib, CPython). It contains no
attribution notice for presenton itself, and none of those packages is part of
the files listed above. Under §4(d) only notices that pertain to the
Derivative Work must be carried, so no part of it is reproduced here.
